00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:37.030
It's optimized for that.

00:02:37.030 --> 00:02:39.280
And it's code first
kind of thinking.

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:43.240
Container Engine is a system
of containers working together

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:44.800
to solve your problems.

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:46.360
And Compute Engine
is, basically,

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:48.526
