00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:26.350
And for the most part,
they inherit the attributes

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:27.220
of the lower layers.

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:30.200
So you just get to work at a
higher level of abstraction,

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:32.074
so kind of a more
focused workload.

00:03:32.074 --> 00:03:33.490
So I'm going to
start with bottom,

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:35.281
work our way up, talk
about things that are

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:37.060
a really good fit for those.

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:40.240
And you may, at the end of
